Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 05:23:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Keep an open sheet on the Lightkeeper's phone across the
 die

On the phone's Lightkeeper desk the die and back again closed a member's or a
request's sheet that was open, where the player's die keeps the tab that was
on show. The die (and Pass notes) now keep the page under them on the pages
with the table beside them (Roster, Requests, Circle), and the die pressed
again comes back to the same page with its sheet; choosing a page from the
drawer still closes the sheet.

Checked in Chromium at 390x844: a sheet opened from a business card is back
after the die and back; every drawer page and the tabs at 1366x768,
1280x720, 1920x1080 and 820x1180 still work with no page errors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ETKqHLvkfH9k99JTnJzzKA
---
 frontend/src/components/gm/OperationsPanel.jsx | 18 ++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

